{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS疑似SSH暴力破解。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Potential macOS SSH Brute Force Detected。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS疑似SSH暴力破解","references":["https://themittenmac.com/detecting-ssh-activity-via-process-monitoring/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"ace1e989-a541-44df-93a8-a8b0591b63c0","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:macos and event.type:start and process.name:\"sshd-keygen-wrapper\" and process.parent.name:launchd\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS疑似SSH暴力破解\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threshold":{"field":["host.id"],"value":20},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1110","name":"Brute Force","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1133","name":"External Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1133/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
